  "releaseNotes": "LDAP cache keyed by composite (domain_name, user_id) in separate indexed columns; GetUser with unknown domain now resolves from cache by iterating configured domains instead of bypassing; startup reconciliation drops only rows for domains no longer configured (never purges on an ordinary recycle); auth/login bind to the supplied domain (first configured domain as fallback) instead of iterating all domains; assumes a single domain or trusted forest with forest-unique sAMAccountName (SearchGroupsInAllDomainsAtLogin removed); INFO logs moved to DEBUG except AD-request timing; richer memberOf fallback-ladder tracing. Builds for net8.0 and net10.0.",
